# Git authorship

- All commits and PRs must use the human git user only (`dms` / the repo owner's account).
- **Never** add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `cursoragent@cursor.com`, or "Made with Cursor" trailers.
- Prefer `git commit` messages without any AI attribution footer.
- If Cursor tooling injects a trailer anyway, strip it before push (repo `.githooks/commit-msg`).
- Do not change `user.name` / `user.email` git config.
